SQL Questions: 1. Write  a query to retrieve the EmpFname and EmpLname in a single column as “FullName”. The first name and the last name must be separated with space.




SELECT CONCAT(EmpFname,' ',EmpLname) as FullName from employee







2. Write a query find number of employees whose DOB is between 02/05/1970 to 31/12/1975 and are grouped according to gender


select gender, count(*) as no_of_emp from employee where DOB between '1970-05-02' and '1975-12-31' group by gender
